# Aurora, Maiden of the Glacier

> Aurora is a mid mage who turns Magic Power into longer lockdown, not just bigger damage. Pick her when the enemy has to walk into objectives and your team can protect a backline caster. Pick her into double assassin, Diggie, or long-range poke and the freeze becomes a liability instead of a win condition.

