Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-07. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Freeze Burst (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Glowing Wand, Blood Wings, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Glowing Wand, Blood Wings, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when your team needs more frequent freeze cycles and the enemy is not buying early Magic Defense.; Lightning Truncheon over Wishing Lantern when Use when the enemy backline is the only target that matters and your team can already handle tanks.; Winter Crown over Wishing Lantern when Use when one dive assassin can reach you before the second freeze lands.
- Total cost: 12060 gold

Default ranked mid build that buys early burn and shield value, then turns late Magic Power into longer fight-winning freezes.

### Ultimate Reset Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Lightning Truncheon, Fleeting Time, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy mid lane is punishable and flat Magic Penetration matters more than cooldown tempo.; Glowing Wand over Fleeting Time when Use when your team lacks anti-heal or you are not getting the assists needed to trigger resets.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when backline access from assassins decides fights before extra Magic Power can matter.
- Total cost: 12080 gold

Snowball control setup for games where Aurora can safely collect assists and cycle Frigid Glacier through consecutive objective fights.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Glowing Wand, Winter Crown, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Immortality over Blood Wings when Use in late Lord defense when Aurora's passive is down and one death ends the game.; Ice Queen Wand over Divine Glaive when Use when enemies have low Magic Defense but keep walking out of your team's follow-up damage.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but not control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude.
- Total cost: 11730 gold

Defensive mid setup for hard engage and pick comps where Aurora's main job is to survive the first lockout and still cast the freeze chain.

